<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>game.bubblesCollected %lld</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>ເກັບເປືອກຫອຍໄດ້ %lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>ເກັບເປືອກຫອຍໄດ້ %lld</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>home.nextCharacter %lld %@</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>ຕ້ອງການເປືອກຫອຍອີກ %1$lld ເພື່ອປົດລັອກ %2$@</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>ຕ້ອງການເປືອກຫອຍອີກ %1$lld ເພື່ອປົດລັອກ %2$@</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>home.pausedCards %lld</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>ເປືອກຫອຍ %lld ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນເກມທີ່ຢຸດພັກ</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>ເປືອກຫອຍ %lld ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນເກມທີ່ຢຸດພັກ</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>levelIntro.cardsBullet %lld</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>ໃນດ່ານນີ້ ເຈົ້າເກັບໄດ້ສູງສຸດ **ເປືອກຫອຍ %lld**.</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>ໃນດ່ານນີ້ ເຈົ້າເກັບໄດ້ສູງສຸດ **ເປືອກຫອຍ %lld**.</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
